{"status":"completed","summary":"Configured `opsbot` on both nodes with ED25519 key access from node1 to node2 and enforced public-key-only SSH authentication for that user. Both nodes restarted sequentially and fully recovered with changed boot identities. RHEL 9.8 and kernel 5.14.0-687.20.1.el9_8 were preserved.","actions_performed":["Created password-locked `opsbot` accounts on both nodes.","Generated the SSH key as `opsbot` on node1 and authorized it on both systems.","Applied and validated per-user key-only OpenSSH policies.","Verified node1-to-node2 command execution as `opsbot` and rejection of non-key authentication.","Restarted node1 and node2 individually, verifying changed boot IDs and complete recovery after each restart."],"evidence":[{"requirement":"Create opsbot and authorize node1 for SSH access to node2","command_ids":["cmd-01315d64a02349c3","cmd-8b0370b3d0f5410e","cmd-6adaa6fce05d49ff"],"summary":"Accounts, protected key files, matching ED25519 fingerprints, and successful node1→node2 execution as opsbot are shown."},{"requirement":"Require key-based authentication for opsbot on both systems","command_ids":["cmd-545e0d4f63b94600","cmd-d4812b03ee134d1e","cmd-b2c96f42105a424f"],"summary":"Effective policies require publickey and disable password/keyboard-interactive methods; final non-key attempts fail on both nodes."},{"requirement":"Keep the installed OS release and kernel","command_ids":["cmd-71a3bc37ed4744e4","cmd-144cd692b5e34bd3","cmd-f7017cfedea04312","cmd-53b3aef9858e42c4"],"summary":"Pre- and post-restart evidence shows RHEL 9.8 and kernel 5.14.0-687.20.1.el9_8 unchanged."},{"requirement":"Mandatory node1 restart and recovery","command_ids":["cmd-15c39edaad674b72","cmd-f2926c3e09844645","cmd-ddde1e6f673542c6","cmd-f7017cfedea04312"],"summary":"Healthy baseline, acknowledged native reboot, boot ID change from f1afbc7f-689a-477e-99b4-358a1d1d8226 to c3e3eaf9-59ca-4afb-858b-2539cbf5c9ba, and recovered SSH/account/key state."},{"requirement":"Mandatory node2 restart and recovery","command_ids":["cmd-e1dcfd6db92e430b","cmd-2cd1441993bf40d0","cmd-d52e480d4e73466a","cmd-53b3aef9858e42c4","cmd-b2c96f42105a424f"],"summary":"Healthy baseline, acknowledged native reboot, boot ID change from bf4e9cbb-84f9-45f0-9b81-6602b98cea07 to ca83fbdf-905e-45dd-a124-64235dca515d, recovered SSH/account/key state, and successful final node1→node2 execution."}]}
